  unitNumber: 202
  description: A monster that mimics a treasure chest. It's unknown how it folds
    and hides its wings while mimicking. It's said a Mimic will evolve into a Winged
    Mimic after eating a great number of things, organic or otherwise. This may result
    in it granting a much more powerful effect than a normal Mimic when used as fusion
    material.
  summonDesc: Delicious! Stinky! Ouch!<br>Meat, organs, blood, bones...<br>Get in
    my belly!
